                        "name": "Milton D. Miller II",
                        "email": "mdmii@outlook.com",
                        "username": "mdmillerii"
                    },
                    "message": "It is preferable for the links to be relative\n\nThis allows the symlink to be followed when the \nfile system is mounted at an alternative location, \nsuch as the alt mount.\n\n\nHowever that requires understanding the relative path.\nThe python os.path.relpath` or shell  command \n`realpath --relative-to` may be of assistance."
                }
